  "goodToKnow": "Ungestraft means unpunished or with impunity: ungestraft davonkommen (to get off scot-free), Das bleibt nicht ungestraft! (that won't go unpunished). It's usually adverbial. In international law and human rights, the noun is die Straflosigkeit (impunity). From strafen (to punish) and die Strafe."
